WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.520
we all know the feeling of trying to get through&nbsp;
the work we have to do, to get to the work we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:11.760
want to do, and that's where Watson Orchestrate&nbsp;
comes in. Watson Orchestrate helps you get more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:19.040
done by letting you create your very own digital&nbsp;
employees, or digeys. Digeys are extensions of you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.640
that take on different jobs in the background,&nbsp;
while you handle the important stuff. Work that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:30.880
used to take hours, now takes minutes, simply&nbsp;
assign your digeys the tasks you want them to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:37.600
tackle, like sending emails, scheduling meetings,&nbsp;
and expediting requests, and they'll do the rest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:44.480
and they work seamlessly across the apps and&nbsp;
tools you already use like slack, linkedin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:52.080
salesforce, and more. Plus the more you work&nbsp;
together the smarter your digey becomes and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:58.080
more personalized your experience gets. Best&nbsp;
of all digeys give you the freedom to focus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.280
on the work that truly matters&nbsp;
to you and your business.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:11.840
It's time to leave the busy work&nbsp;
behind welcome to Watson Orchestrate.

